  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-73552\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>First, let's sketch our region.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-73552-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"https://mathacademy.com/graphics/q-73552-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>We have the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The vertical line <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"73\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> intersects the region in two separate intervals, as shown below. So, this can't be a type I region. </li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-73552-e-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"https://mathacademy.com/graphics/q-73552-e-1\"></div>\n\n<ul>\n<li>The horizontal line <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"74\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.25</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> intersects the region in two separate intervals, as shown below. So, this can't be a type II region. </li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-73552-e-2\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"https://mathacademy.com/graphics/q-73552-e-2\"></div>\n\n<p>Therefore, only statement III is true.</p>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">II and III only</div></div>",
